Z||000000||WisconsinGT||06-11-2000||10:04 PM||||Well, my car is making a strange noise sometimes. It seems that after certain startups, I hear a slight wine coming from the middle of the car. I also feel a slight vibration on my auto shifter. If I turn the car I hear it. If I apply the brakes I hear it. Funny thing is, if I turn off the car (To get gas) then start it up all is well. I am confused! It has been happening for about 1 week. Also, today while this was happening, It  was stalling while coming to a stop. Any ideas?<P>Thanks to all that helped me figure out how to install the trans. filter. It was messy. I cannot believe that there is a small piece of metal that helps hold the filter into place. I think all went well. I feel a bit weird after the install though. I hope the filter stays put.||||reg||1
